#. translators: Message shown when someone opens a translation job that WPML
#. no longer has.
#: classes/editor/Editor.php:786
msgid ""
"This translation job no longer exists. It may have been cancelled or "
"replaced by a newer job. Find the content in the list below, or ask a "
"translation manager to send it to translation again."
